---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Innovation in Last-Mile Healthcare Delivery: The Chitta Express Model | Causewave"
  description="How we delivered 33+ lakh vaccinations to remote tribal areas using innovative mobile healthcare units."
  ogTitle="Chitta Express Innovation | Causewave Insights"
  ogDescription="SKOCH Gold Award-winning innovation in last-mile healthcare delivery."
  canonicalPath="/insights/chitta-express-innovation"
  activePage="insights"
>
  <!-- Article Header -->
  <div class="page-header text-white py-10" style={`background-image: url('${base}insights-bg.jpg')`}>
    <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
      <nav class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4">
        <a href={`${base}insights`} class="hover:text-white">Insights</a>
        <span class="mx-1">/</span>
        <span>Healthcare Innovation</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i> SKOCH Gold Award
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> IIM Case Study
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-4">Innovation in Last-Mile Healthcare: The Chitta Express Model</h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-slate-400 text-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-sky-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-semibold text-xs">HP</div>
          <span class="text-white font-medium">Dr. Hemant L. Patel</span>
        </div>
        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-clock mr-1"></i> 8 min read</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mt-6">
          <div class="bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-lg text-center">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold text-sky-400">33 Lakh+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-300">Vaccinations</div>
          </div>
        <div class="bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="text-xl font-bold text-teal-400">20</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-300">Mobile Units</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400">100%</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-300">Coverage</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="text-xl font-bold text-sky-400">2.4M</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-300">Population</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Article Content -->
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <!-- Main Content -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-8 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 mb-6">
          In early 2021, as India launched its nationwide COVID-19 vaccination drive, we faced a unique challenge in Panchmahal district, Gujarat. How do you vaccinate 2.4 million people spread across remote tribal areas with limited road access and deep-rooted vaccine hesitancy? The answer: <strong>Chitta Express</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">The Challenge</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-2 text-slate-900">Geographic Barriers</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs">
              <li>5,231 sq km of rugged terrain</li>
              <li>Narrow, unpaved paths</li>
              <li>Monsoon-inaccessible areas</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-2 text-slate-900">Cultural Resistance</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs">
              <li>42% tribal population</li>
              <li>Deep mistrust of govt initiatives</li>
              <li>Traditional healing preferences</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-2 text-slate-900">Infrastructure Gaps</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs">
              <li>70.99% literacy rate</li>
              <li>Limited healthcare facilities</li>
              <li>No public transportation</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-sky-500 pl-4 my-6 italic text-sm">
          <p class="mb-1">"Why should we waste money traveling to the vaccination center when we are already healthy?"</p>
          <cite class="text-xs not-italic text-slate-500">— Tribal community members</cite>
        </blockquote>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">The Innovation: Chitta Express</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 to-white border border-sky-100 p-4 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-xl mb-2">🏍️</div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-1 text-slate-900">Chitta Bikes (10 units)</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs">
              <li>Navigate narrow, rugged paths</li>
              <li>Two-person team</li>
              <li>Real-time CoWIN data upload</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-50 to-white border border-teal-100 p-4 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-xl mb-2">🚐</div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-1 text-slate-900">Sanjeevani Vans (10 units)</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs">
              <li>Cover accessible areas</li>
              <li>Three-person team</li>
              <li>Mobile vaccination stations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Measurable Impact</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-600 to-sky-800 text-white p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold">33,00,000+</div>
            <div class="text-xs">Vaccinations Delivered</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-600 to-teal-800 text-white p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold">100%</div>
            <div class="text-xs">Remote Area Coverage</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-600 to-emerald-800 text-white p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold">8K+</div>
            <div class="text-xs">Direct Beneficiaries</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Key Learnings</h2>
        <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
          <div class="flex gap-3 items-start bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-sky-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</div>
            <div><strong class="text-slate-900">Agility Over Infrastructure</strong> — Mobile units overcome limitations better than fixed facilities.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-3 items-start bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-teal-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</div>
            <div><strong class="text-slate-900">Community Leaders as Bridges</strong> — Local influencers essential for overcoming resistance.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-3 items-start bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</div>
            <div><strong class="text-slate-900">Technology-Enabled Personalization</strong> — Real-time data for responsive delivery.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-3 items-start bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-sky-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</div>
            <div><strong class="text-slate-900">Multi-Modal Approach</strong> — Different terrains require different solutions.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Recognition</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100 p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
            <div class="text-xl mb-1">🏆</div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-xs text-slate-900">SKOCH Gold Award</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-sky-50 border border-sky-100 p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
            <div class="text-xl mb-1">📚</div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-xs text-slate-900">IIM Raipur Case Study</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
            <div class="text-xl mb-1">🏛️</div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-xs text-slate-900">Government Recognition</h4>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Author Bio -->
        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-sky-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold flex-shrink-0">HP</div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-900 mb-1">About the Author</h4>
              <p class="text-xs"><strong>Dr. Hemant L. Patel</strong> is the Founder & CEO of Causewave Innovations LLP, bringing nearly two decades of experience in public health innovation.</p>
              <a href={`${base}about`} class="text-sky-600 text-xs font-semibold hover:text-sky-700 mt-1 inline-block">View Full Profile <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="lg:col-span-4">
        <div class="sticky top-16 space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-3 text-slate-900">Highlights</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-0.5"></i> 33+ lakh vaccinations</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-0.5"></i> SKOCH Gold Award</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-0.5"></i> IIM case study</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-0.5"></i> 100% coverage</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-3 text-slate-900">Download</h4>
            <a href={`${base}content/chitta_bike/87321_CaseCompCopy_Sujal Jayantibhai Mayatra.pdf`} target="_blank" class="flex items-center gap-2 p-3 bg-white rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-all">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf text-red-600"></i>
              <div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-xs text-slate-900">IIM Case Study</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">PDF</div>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white p-4 rounded-xl">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-2">Interested in Healthcare Innovation?</h4>
            <a href={`${base}contact`} class="block text-center px-4 py-2 bg-white text-slate-900 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-slate-100 transition-all">
              Contact Us
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
